      <body><p><b>The official AFARS regulation resides on the Army’s Knowledge Management Portal PAM.  If you do not have CAC access to PAM, please visit the Army Contracting Enterprise’s public facing website “Army Connect” at <xref href="https://www.army.mil/armycontracting#org-afars" scope="external" format="html">https://www.army.mil/armycontracting#org-afars</xref>.  The AFARS will return to Acquisition.gov upon completion of the RFO.</b></p>
         <p>
            <i>(Revised 01 October 2024)</i>
